setAccountingCurrency.t.sol
├── when call is reentrant
│  └── it should revert
└── when call is not reentrant
   ├── when caller is not the module's safe
   │  └── it should revert with UnauthorizedCaller
   └── when caller is the module's safe
      ├── given the provided currency is not the reference currency (address zero) and price data is not registered for it
      │  └── it should revert with PriceFeedRouteNotRegistered
      └── given the provided currency is the reference currency (address zero) or price data is registered for it
         ├── it should set the provided currency as the accounting currency in contract storage
         └── it should emit an AccountingCurrencyChanged event
